# Shell scripts MUST ship as LF — a CRLF vps-bootstrap.sh is a broken
# vps-bootstrap.sh (bash dies on `\r`), and the published sha256 must match
# the bytes raw.githubusercontent.com serves, which are the blob's bytes.
# Forcing eol=lf makes the blob, the checkout, and the served file agree.
*.sh text eol=lf
